# MCP server config. `claude mcp add --scope project` writes the bearer token into this file in
# plaintext, and this repository is public — so it is ignored rather than trusted to be redacted.
# Server config belongs in local scope (`/root/.claude.json`), which is where `claude mcp add`
# puts it by default.
.mcp.json
